  "translation": "Gomme Pinehase morwa wa Elazara moperisita a bolela go barwa ba Reubene, le go barwa ba Gade, le go barwa ba Manase: Gajee re tseba gore Yahwe o lego gare ga rena, ka gobane le ka se fetogile go Yahwe ka go feta tsela ye; bjale le hodisitše ⟨את⟩ barwa ba Yisraele go tloga ka seatleng sa Yahwe.",
